  "description": "AI integration for Bowire — registers a Microsoft.Extensions.AI IChatClient and exposes the workbench's chat / probe endpoints. This core package ships only the seam + the default Ollama / LM Studio connector via OllamaSharp (auto-detect on 127.0.0.1:11434 / :1234). Cloud providers and the MCP-client-reversal seam ship as separate optional packages so embedded hosts only pay for what they install: Kuestenlogik.Bowire.Ai.OpenAi for OpenAI + OpenRouter, Kuestenlogik.Bowire.Ai.Anthropic for Claude, Kuestenlogik.Bowire.Ai.Mcp for MCP-as-gateway. Embedded hosts can also register their own IChatClient before AddBowireAi() to reuse existing AI infrastructure. Same opt-in shape as the protocol plugins.",
